Today, 6:00 pm CET, a planned server and client update will drop the game’s server connection for about 15 minutes. During that time the players won’t be able to access the server and respectively -play the game. We apologize for the inconvenience!

Here’s the change log for the update:
1.	Server side
-	Fixing issues with the Night Attack not “passing through”;
-	Fixing post-Night Attack game lagging issues;
-	Implementing new game balance changes.

2.	Client Side
-	Global Map UI optimization;
-	Fixing known UI issues;
-	Fixing the bug causing the Search option to not be available;
-	Fixing the bug that prevented the Village Daily Report not be available right after a Player’s death during the Night Attack;

If you feel that we ARE making a difference with our updates, please consider writing a positive review on Grimwood’s Steam Store page. This will be immensely appreciated and will also be a great way to help both the game and the team behind it. Thank you! 

Here are the new Features/Changes included in the update:
•	A new "Pick a Village to Play In" function. This allows you to play in the same Village with your Steam Friends, so - go on, make some new Steam Friends :); 
Important: Please note that in order to work this feature needs you to switch your Steam account to Public Mode (the default option.) 
•	Full French and Spanish Localization;
•	Faster and more effective “Banish a Player” procedure;
•	Perk Re-rolls are now up to 10;
•	Use of the Rejuvenation Elixir will be restricted to one elixir per day per Villager.

Today, from 15:30 till 16:00 CET, there will be a planned server update. During that time the players will lose connection with the server preventing them from playing the game. We appologize for the inconvenience!

Here’s a list with the updates and improvements (which should take effect after the game server is back online):
- Fixed the bug causing Monsters to sometimes not visualize instantly on global map;
- Fixed the problem, preventing perk re-rolling for New Characters;
- Gravestones now disappear during after the daily resolve;
- Bandages are more now more effective;
- Dehydration now happens a bit sooner;
- Fixed the bug causing additional Sanity loss in battle;
- Fixed the bug causing already dead player to be attacked in Battle.

Change Log:
1. UI polish and optimization;
2. Attack cool-down added (giving all players in a Battle the time react to actions of the others ;)
3. Fixed issue with alive players in Battle loosing too much Sanity when another Player dies in the same Battle; 
4. In Battle the weapons are sorted by hit chance;
5. Fixed issue causing too many Ponds to be generated;
6. Night attack fixes and optimizations;
7. Woodcutters can no longer be Clumsy;
8. Hatchet no longer requires quarterstaff to be made.
